SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS SPECIFICATION (SRS)
1. Introduction
1.1 Purpose

The purpose of this system is to develop a web-based on-demand home service booking platform that connects users with nearby service professionals such as cleaners, electricians, plumbers, and appliance repair technicians.

The system will allow users to:

Search for services

View nearby workers

Book services

Track service progress

View service history

Get price quotations

Workers will receive service requests and update work status, while the admin manages the entire platform.

The system will be developed using the MERN stack to ensure scalability and real-time communication.

1.2 Scope

The platform will provide services including:

Home Cleaning

Electrical Repair

Plumbing

AC Repair

Appliance Repair

General Home Maintenance

Main actors in the system:

Admin

Worker (Service Provider)

User (Customer)

The platform will allow:

User registration and login

Worker registration and verification

Service booking

Real-time work tracking

Pricing estimation

Final billing

Ratings and reviews

1.3 Definitions
Term	Description
